{"id": "c20", "kind": "doc", "text": "요청은 도구 정의, 시스템 프롬프트, 대화 순서로 나가고 CLAUDE.md 는 대화의 맨 앞에 있다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "원문 §Prompt caching", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Prompt caching", "quote": "requests always go out in the same order: tool definitions, then the system prompt, then the conversation (with CLAUDE.md at the front of it)"}]}
{"id": "c21", "kind": "doc", "text": "opusplan 은 plan 모드에 들어가고 나올 때마다 모델이 바뀌므로 캐시가 깨진다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "원문 §Prompt caching (/model)", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Prompt caching (/model)", "quote": "every model has its own cache, so on the next turn the entire conversation gets prefilled again at full price. (This includes opusplan, which switches models every time you go in or out of plan mode.)"}]}
{"id": "c22", "kind": "doc", "text": "fast mode 를 끄는 것은 캐시 관점에서 무료다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "원문 §Prompt caching (Fast mode)", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Prompt caching (Fast mode)", "quote": "also part of the key, and the re-prefill happens at fast mode prices, so if you're going to turn it on, turn it on at the start. (Turning it off again is free, cache-wise.)"}]}
{"id": "c23", "kind": "doc", "text": "서브에이전트는 자기 시스템 프롬프트와 도구와 내 CLAUDE.md 를 받지만 내 대화는 받지 않는다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "원문 §Subagents", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Subagents", "quote": "A subagent gets its own context window, with its own system prompt, the tools, and your CLAUDE.md, but not your conversation."}]}
{"id": "c24", "kind": "doc", "text": "/rewind 는 끝의 턴만 잘라내므로 비용이 들지 않고 /compact 는 대화 전체를 다시 써서 항상 비용이 든다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "원문 §Prompt caching (/rewind tip)", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Prompt caching (/rewind tip)", "quote": "Rewinding only cuts those turns off the end, so everything before them is still cached and it costs nothing. Compacting rewrites the whole conversation, so it always costs something."}]}
{"id": "c25", "kind": "doc", "text": "대화에 들어간 것은 그 뒤 모든 턴에 다시 전송되며 세션이 끝날 때까지 그렇다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "원문 §What decides how many tokens a session sends", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§What decides how many tokens a session sends", "quote": "Everything that ends up in the conversation, a file Claude read or the output of a command it ran, gets sent again on every turn after it, for the rest of the session."}]}
{"id": "c26", "kind": "doc", "text": "파일을 나중 턴에 다시 @멘션하면 대개 사본이 하나 더 붙는다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "원문 §What ends up in the context (@-mention tip)", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§What ends up in the context (@-mention tip)", "quote": "The file itself takes up the same room in the context either way, so you only need to mention it once per conversation: it stays there, and @-mentioning it again on a later turn generally attaches a second copy."}]}
{"id": "c27", "kind": "doc", "text": "구독에서도 같은 요청이 한도를 깎는다", "verdict": "confirmed", "scope": "원문 §Prompt caching", "evidence": [{"source": "w1", "locator": "§Prompt caching", "quote": "This applies on a subscription too. You don't see these prices directly, but the same requests are what draw down your limits."}]}
